{"ts":"2026-08-01T19:43:40.505Z","type":"quest-declared","sealed":{"doneWhen":{"probe":"scenario-harness","args":{"scenario":"rolling-restart-pre-handoff-recovery-discriminator","consecutive":3,"metric":"priority"}},"frontierMetrics":[{"probe":"scenario-harness","args":{"scenario":"rolling-restart-pre-handoff-recovery-discriminator","metric":"priority"}}],"authoringContractVersion":1,"statement":"A restarted-node recovery timeout preserves direct-target startup handoff evidence (startup branch, infrastructure-join completion, canonical-authority consumption/state/source, and transaction-recovery state/readiness/outcome) into terminalRecoveryReadiness and deterministically attributes the earliest incomplete transition without treating bootstrap or control-plane reachability as recovery readiness.","title":null,"class":"process","constraints":[{"id":"source-change-subagent-verification","statement":"If this Quest changes source code, spawn a subagent verifier before audit and git handoff, then record a Solver finding with evidence subagent:<id>."},{"id":"earliest-incomplete-transition","statement":"Classify the direct target in causal order: incomplete infrastructure join precedes missing canonical-authority consumption, which precedes transaction recovery not started/pending/failed. Bootstrap health, admin health, and control-plane recovery are observations only and cannot skip an earlier incomplete transition."},{"id":"structured-evidence-not-text-only","statement":"The failure bundle and restart-recovery stability gate must retain the structured direct-target fields; human-readable timeout text alone is not closure. Preserve null/unknown honestly when older evidence lacks a field."},{"id":"retained-signature-reproduction","statement":"A deterministic fixture matching the retained N=15 restart timeout (bootstrap reachable, admin refused, control-plane recovery ready, canonical authority false, transaction recovery not_started) must remain blocked and must not be misclassified as recovered."},{"id":"diagnostic-only-boundary","statement":"Do not change startup runtime behavior, recovery activation, bootstrap routing, load, readiness predicates, or timeout budgets. This Quest closes the missing discriminator only; a later product Quest owns whichever lifecycle transition the evidence selects."},{"id":"formal-model-scope","statement":"The current TLA+ readiness-handoff model assumes eventual pre-handoff serviceability and the current Alloy model checks static owner cardinality, so neither distinguishes the retained trace while infrastructureJoinComplete is absent. Run the existing model-contract gate for adjacency, but extend a model only if this Quest changes lifecycle semantics beyond evidence projection."}],"verificationTemplates":["formation-circularity","harness-fidelity","recovery-replay"],"frontierIds":["rolling-restart-pre-handoff-recovery-discriminator-main"]}}
{"ts":"2026-08-01T19:51:26.216Z","type":"finding","frontier":"rolling-restart-pre-handoff-recovery-discriminator-main","claim":"The retained N=15 timeout text preserves canonicalAuthorityConsumed=false and transactionRecoveryState=not_started but omits infrastructureJoinComplete, so it cannot directly distinguish a pre-join stall from a post-join authority-consumption stall. Run 9 curated logs reach cluster connection completion and registration but never final join/SQL handoff before timeout, constraining the next product investigation to the infrastructure-join/registration boundary.","kind":null,"evidence":"test-output/reports/stat-gate-20260801T175257Z-run9.report.json","rulesOut":"Attributing the retained failures directly to transaction-recovery activation from control-plane or bootstrap reachability alone","verification":null,"regressionClassification":null,"scopePressureClassification":null}
